ite-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">終其尾</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一場 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;空</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><br />\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（作者是中山醫學大學台語系學生）</span></span></b></b></div>"
